{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf","id":1305479,"title":"Contagion in WtF","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Werewolf: The Forsaken"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-04-17T08:18:13-07:00","id":1305479,"title":"Contagion in WtF","content":"As I prepare to run <b>Contagion Chronicle</b> storyline in my <b>Werewolf</b> chronicles, I made analysis of how gameline setting ideas can relate to Plagues elements, for anchoring it in game. As I already done that, I thought I will share with fan community here and start broader discussion. Enjoy!<br /> <br /> <b><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Enemies</span></b></b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Fire-Touched</b> \u2013 Uratha Tribe under patronage of Wolf God of Truth and Sickness sounds already as interested in Contagion. When you add that <i>Izidakh </i>are obsessed with Spirit World and it\u2019s ecology, clearly any Plague that is affecting spirits is their first concern. Concerning Sworn/False divide, by their religious favor they often come to <i>Jeremiad</i>, and by more doomsday vibe they relate to <i>Naglfar\u2019s Army</i>.</li> <li><b>Bale Hounds </b>\u2013 Cursed wolves of Maeljin are aiming for the end of the world, so <i>Naglfar\u2019s Army</i> is natural faction for them. Contagion outbreaks can point to literal Hell on Earth when Plague swept through the region.</li> <li><b>Hosts </b>\u2013 Some Contagion strains are weakening Gauntlet, or even other dimensions. Hosts like <i>Beshilu</i>, that are dedicated in the end destroying of Barrier are natural allies for this forces, even if rats can be ignorant of the greater power they serve.</li> </ol>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-17-2019, 04:09 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T06:22:58-07:00","id":1305715,"title":"","content":"Over 60 views and no resposnes? Come on, wolfpeople, there should be more connections for Contagion ideas in WtF gameline!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T06:43:57-07:00","id":1305718,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1305715#post1305715\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Over 60 views and no resposnes? Come on, wolfpeople, there should be more connections for Contagion ideas in WtF gameline!</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm actually more focused on the moonshunned. Someone can please resume to me how contagion will work? So I can say my own opinion about wtf <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#800000\">-'' </span>We are the unsullied.<br /> We are the inheritors.<br /> We are the Pure <span style=\"color:#800000\">''-</span>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3773-helur","name":"Helur","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3773_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"352"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-18T07:00:39-07:00","id":1305719,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Helur</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1305718#post1305718\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone can please resume to me how contagion will work? So I can say my own opinion about wtf <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>'Contagion' is broad term over vastly different regional events that break base reality in area, in some way. They are only put together as it's seem all those different effects are 'spreading' like a disease in various ecologies they start in - going even to mortals and other supernatural beings.<br /> <br /> For now we have those shown as example Contagions:<ul><li>Parallel universe bleeds of beings and places ( Edinburgh, New Zealand )</li> <li>Vampires rising blood addiction and light sensitivity in all around them ( Edinburgh )</li> <li>Suicidal depression sticking to every self-conscious being ( Odense )</li> <li>Ghosts becoming material, permanently ( San Francisco )</li> <li>Corruption that makes you immortal and/or mutated ( Kyoto )</li> <li>And few other I did not read yet...</li> </ul>My own example idea: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\">Contagion of Being</a>, that slowly erase ephemeral and physical beings from reality.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-18-2019, 10:11 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T18:22:11-07:00","id":1308190,"title":"","content":"did you by any chance check out my Host's Vectors in the original thread?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T18:37:03-07:00","id":1308199,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1308190#post1308190\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">did you by any chance check out my Host's Vectors in the original thread?</div> </div> </div> </div>Oh, I missed them. Quick search in topic...<br /> <br /> Here they start - for ease of referenace, I will quote them, <b>Nicolas</b><br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1302187#post1302187\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Guys, I have homebrewed some Host Edges.<br /> <br /> check it out!<br /> Host Edges for the Fervor Vector<br /> <br /> \u2022 Purification<br /> Hosts are disrupting force through and through,they are about building power by absorbing themselve into an<br /> terrible amalgamation. with this Edge,they can waive the Willpower cost of purification,instead they sacrifice another<br /> Host to their progenitor torning his enemy apart to shed the Condition.<br /> \u2022\u2022 Divine Revelation<br /> Ironically,many of the more lucid Hosts place value in loyalty. After all,when you are a god-fragment trying to recuparate your<br /> former glory,it pays to have loyal helpers. By spending one more Willpower point,the Host can inflict the Mesmerized condition<br /> on the target of this Vector,as well as the normal effect of the power.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Cleansing Flame<br /> The Hosts,remember what they once were. Not in their minds,but in their flesh and bone. When they reach for the Heavens<br /> to wield the Sacred fire,they are indeed calling on the remains of their Progenitor. With Cleansing Flame<br /> they can infect the victims of this power with a Shard of themselves.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Modern Miracle<br /> Hosts are in many ways,profanity given shape. They corrupt the Gauntlet,the sacred barrier between the Flesh and Shadow.<br /> therefore they can choose to affect targets on both sides of the Gauntlet with their Miracles.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Godhead<br /> Make no mistake,Hosts were once Gods,they were monsters and scavengers and plagues,but above all else,they were Gods.<br /> And now,it's time for them to reclaim their ancient glory and birthright.<br /> When they use godhead,they can affect te Gauntlet without any Essence cost,and they can choose to harm the Gauntlet in one turn<br /> as if they were harming it for a month.</div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Nicolas Milioni</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1299967-contagion-chronicle-kickstarter?p=1302376#post1302376\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">part 2 of my Host Edges<br /> Host Edges for the Authority Vector.<br /> \u2022 Surveillance<br /> Hosts are everywhere,or at least,their shards are. They know their away around tehcnology,they know how to watch<br /> and listen for what's necessary. And sometimes,they ca brute-force their away into information instead of using finesse<br /> Hosts replace Intelligence with Strenght for the Roll. Furthermore,they can spend Essence to gain Successes,each 5 Essence<br /> points grants the Host one automatic Sucess.<br /> \u2022\u2022 The Boss Is In<br /> When you see the monstruos,terrifying and awe-inspiring monster enter the room,you know the Boss is indeed In.<br /> The Host can choose one member of the organization he is taking control of,that member will always have a Perfect impression<br /> of the Host for the rest of the session.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022 Plutomancy<br /> Money may seem useless for something as uncontrollable as a Host,but even they may use a litttle green to make things easier for themselves<br /> Furthermore,they can consume each other's money in very real way. By sacrificing and devouring another shard,the Host may gain an extra Plutomancy point.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 Panopticon<br /> The Hosts were once parts of beings who could see into may layers of reality,include the abodes of other beings of similar power<br /> if the Host uses the senses of another Host,he can extend the period of this power to 72 hours.<br /> \u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022\u2022 The Big Lie<br /> Some people are never the same after seeing the might of a Host. The host can choose a person who has heard the lie,that person<br /> will forever believe the lie,no matter what proof he sees of the contrary.</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T18:38:53-07:00","id":1308202,"title":"","content":"i'm very proud of those","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T18:44:17-07:00","id":1308206,"title":"","content":"But, wait, now thinking about them - <b>You think that Hosts have place in Sworn factions?</b> Like Beshilu Rat Mans that ate inside out of poor fellow and now reside there dozens of Hosts Shards... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Like, for me, it's a bit too terrifying. Also, Hosts sounds much more on False side, as they want to <b><i>spread</i></b> the Contagion, not limit it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-26-2019, 09:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T19:08:47-07:00","id":1308215,"title":"","content":"Their drive is to rebirth their progenitor. It's possible some will gain the intelligence to realize the Contagion may be aspects of their progenitor sending instructions on how to do so, thus join the Rosetta Society. The Cryptocracy offers power and knowledge that most groups wouldn't refuse. Something like the Theseans could be appealing to particularly powerful and torn members like Ariadne, who wish to try to change themselves to avoid their destiny, but could also be appealing to hosts who perhaps think changing what they are might be a better way to bring back the Spinner Hag, Carrion Prince or whoever.<br /> <br /> I think they'd certainly lean towards the False but wouldn't be limited to it, especially once you get to the point where they're intelligent enough to gain some independence and agency.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-26T19:11:37-07:00","id":1308217,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1308206#post1308206\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">But, wait, now thinking about them - <b>You think that Hosts have place in Sworn factions?</b> Like Beshilu Rat Mans that ate inside out of poor fellow and now reside there dozens of Hosts Shards... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Like, for me, it's a bit too terrifying. Also, Hosts sounds much more on False side, as they want to <b><i>spread</i></b> the Contagion, not limit it.</div> </div> </div> </div>Think of it this way,if the contagion does to the gauntlet the oposite of what the hosts want,they will want to oppose it. Besides,they have their uses as spies and foot soldiers also, remember <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1188594-and-a-trophy-made-from-my-enemies/page5\">A</a>riadne? Imagine what she can do either for the sworn and the false. An host of her level is ticking time bom,and a smart sworn could leave such a bomb to explode right on their enemies doors","signature":"","edited":{"userid":4621,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","user":"Nicolas Milioni","date":". 04-26-2019, 10:15 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-04-27T02:39:07-07:00","id":1308265,"title":"","content":"The Beshilu may have deeper connection to the Contagion than the other Hosts (I mean, Rat is known as the Plague King for a reason- who knows? Maybe it went crazy after being infected by the Contagion during Pangaea). Not sure where it would put them, as carriers of ages old strain, but it could serve as a storybook.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-17T07:44:34-07:00","id":1341857,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1309390#post1309390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> (...)<br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response they were are <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Essence per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Consequences of Contagion</span></b><br /> <b>Ephemeral Beings:</b><ul><li><b>Loss of Manifestations </b>\u2013 Slow disappearance of Twilight Form, Reaching, Fetter and Posses or Claim makes ephemerals not possible to affect humans \u2013 so now healing, blessings and overwatching of spiritual entities of humanity. More deadly accidents, weaker tools, and first and foremost \u2013 no influence of ghosts and spirits on the mortals. People are becoming more and more agnostic in their worships.</li> <li><b>Loss of Essence ( and a like ) </b>\u2013 Weaker spirits ( and other ephemerals ) are easier prey for their enemies. Predatory spirits are more violent, weakened by Contagion spirits and ghosts looks for the way to jump over to the Flesh World and collect Essence directly. Spiritual landscapes madness. Hungry Werewolves without Essence and Beasts Satiety going down implies rampaging Uratha and Horrors in physical bodies on Flesh World. Mortals become more dull and detached from their emotions.</li> <li><b>Ephemerals cease to exist </b>\u2013 Like in Loss of Essence, but much more direct. Spirit World and Primordial Dream is turn upside-down with gaps in ecology. Underworld is much more \u2018hungry\u2019 as ghosts-slaves of it are disappearing. All the realms are starting to \u2018steal\u2019 mortals in place of their native ephemerals, to fill the roosters.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>Okay, revisioning my Inconclasm Contagion idea. Reading more rules on Contagion, I see character simply goes from Infected (1) to Infected (2) and then Infected (3) simply by passing times of chapters without cure ( number of Stage +1 ). <b>However, how character goes from Contagion-Touched to Infected (1) Condition?</b> There is a way for stoping the Contagion ( avoid contact with source ), but there are <b>not</b> the rules for when character goes from Touched to Infected, finally.<br /> <br /> Other idea I have - <b>I thinking about adding extra rule for Infected (1) stage for werewolves</b> - where Ephemerals are losing Manifestations, Uratha would get extra Kuruth Triggers. But this seems to imbalance them against other hard hit supernaturals by Contagion - Beasts and Bound/Sin-Eaters - as those groups would <b>not</b> have something this hard on this stage. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Also, deciding extra Kuruth Triggers could be a problem on itself - Do infected Uratha get's new Kuruth Trigger set, with Passive, Common and Specific forms? Only one of them? If only one,<i>which</i> should character get? Maybe it's a too much a hurdle to get werewolves even worst than rest of afflicted monsters... <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/confused.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Confused\" smilieid=\"10\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T22:08:42-07:00","id":1342278,"title":"","content":"<b>Development on my Iconoclasm Contagion</b> - Viking PCs where in small chapel in North Greece. <b>Contagion-Touched Uratha player was trying to drink mass wine.</b> But he already has <i>Blood of Human</i> as Kuruth Trigger. Player in joke wondered if character will react to it as 'they believe it's blood of human'. Went with that, describing how PCs is resisting Basu-Im, changing to Urshul in Wasu-Im he is, with some black veins on the mouth and something that looks like blood, not wine, on his face. Good times! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ( Later I described how he has slight fever in even normal temperature room. )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T08:19:05-07:00","id":1342530,"title":"","content":"There\u2019s some stuff about the Contagion in Shunned by the Moon. And my friend thinks the Malkavia virus is another strain of the Contagion (although that\u2019s not really WtF).","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T08:29:33-07:00","id":1342534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Penelope</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1342530#post1342530\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">And my friend thinks the Malkavia virus is another strain of the Contagion (although that\u2019s not really WtF).</div> </div> </div> </div>I steal your idea for <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1308327-alternative-contagion-origins-brainstorming\"><b>Alternative Contagion Origins</b></a>!<b> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></b><br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T09:21:36-07:00","id":1342542,"title":"","content":"Awesome!!!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"","name":"Guest","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/default/default_avatar_large.png","title":"","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T12:35:44-07:00","id":1343483,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1305719#post1305719\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> 'Contagion' is broad term over vastly different regional events that break base reality in area, in some way. They are only put together as it's seem all those different effects are 'spreading' like a disease in various ecologies they start in - going even to mortals and other supernatural beings.<br /> <br /> For now we have those shown as example Contagions:<ul><li>Parallel universe bleeds of beings and places ( Edinburgh, New Zealand )</li> <li>Vampires rising blood addiction and light sensitivity in all around them ( Edinburgh )</li> <li>Suicidal depression sticking to every self-conscious being ( Odense )</li> <li>Ghosts becoming material, permanently ( San Francisco )</li> <li>Corruption that makes you immortal and/or mutated ( Kyoto )</li> <li>And few other I did not read yet...</li> </ul>My own example idea: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1304126#post1304126\">Contagion of Being</a>, that slowly erase ephemeral and physical beings from reality.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Pardon me, but is there some sort of list and/or codex putting together all these 'contagion' scenarios?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25584-logoth\u00e9t\u0113s","name":"Logoth\u00e9t\u0113s","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25584_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"146"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-24T12:40:44-07:00","id":1343485,"title":"","content":"Probably not until the book is officially out. <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com/wiki/Main_Page\" target=\"_blank\">WoDcodex</a> will likely list them all and offer page numbers. Maybe in the <a href=\"http://wodcodex.com/wiki/Locales_(2nd_Edition)\" target=\"_blank\">Locales page</a>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":886,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","user":"nofather","date":". 10-24-2019, 03:45 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-03-28T08:29:42-07:00","id":1376967,"title":"","content":"I need a bit help with NPCs ideas. <b>I</b><b> need to introduce Bone Shadows wolf-blooded and Uratha pack related to Contagion, that is cantered on the hunting for the interlopers on medieval library.</b> They would be from predecessor to Rosetta Society Sworn, so they would see Contagion as universe massage to decipher and to beat by knowledge. Bonus points if I could use ideas in 800s Constantinopole. Easiest would be using <i>Paeon</i> idea \u2013 but those are pointed as Pure werewolves in <i>Forsaken By Rome</i> from <b>Dark Eras Companion</b>. :/ I have only one idea for particular character \u2013 blind monk guarding secrets of Libarary by second century now, that is going by name Eater of the Dead. And, well, he really eats the dead for knowledge. ( He <i>is </i>the Bone Shadows Ithaeur, after all. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> )","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 03-28-2020, 12:48 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-03T22:18:19-07:00","id":1378473,"title":"","content":"Returning to the topic with interesting game example. I run my <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1345554-dark-eras-byzantine%E2%80%99s-empire-constantinople-uratha\">Constantinople in 800s AD setting</a>. I have underground <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Basilica_Cistern\" target=\"_blank\">Cisterns system</a> ('sewers') defended by Hunter of Darkness pack. And there I have surely rats population in area.<br /> <br /> Seeing how Contagion of the past in New Rome ( CoD <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1303812-contagion-plauges-of-history-origins-of-sworn\">canon event Plague of Justinian / Black Death</a> ) lead to rise of rats and then decline - as humans were fighting the sickness and brought more and more cats to the streets - the rats survived in Cisterns that are now half-forgotten. Now, some of you implied possible cooperation between Sworn and Hosts. With Hunter in Darkness joining religion lead Jeremiad Sworn and possible Beshilu in Cisterns system - is there a way for them to cooperate? I thought about possible twist for players - 'Hunters in Darkness are working with Rats Host! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/eek.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"EEK!\" smilieid=\"9\" class=\"inlineimg\" />' - but more I imagine this, less I see that as possible. HiD pack still needs to call Sacred Hunts from time to time, and what's better target that their 'favorite' Prey?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nofather</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/1305479-contagion-in-wtf?p=1308215#post1308215\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Their drive is to rebirth their progenitor. It's possible some will gain the intelligence to realize the Contagion may be aspects of their progenitor sending instructions on how to do so, thus join the Rosetta Society. The Cryptocracy offers power and knowledge that most groups wouldn't refuse. Something like the Theseans could be appealing to particularly powerful and torn members like Ariadne, who wish to try to change themselves to avoid their destiny, but could also be appealing to hosts who perhaps think changing what they are might be a better way to bring back the Spinner Hag, Carrion Prince or whoever.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bCalling <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar886_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"886\" data-vbnamecard=\"886\">nofather</a>, <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar4621_2.jpeg');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"4621\" data-vbnamecard=\"4621\">Nicolas Milioni</a> &amp; <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight\" style=\"background-image:url('https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5//avatar503_2.png');\" class=\"b-bbcode-user b-bbcode-user--has-avatar js-bbcode-user\" data-userid=\"503\" data-vbnamecard=\"503\">LostLight</a> on this <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 04-04-2020, 03:37 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-04-03T23:57:11-07:00","id":1378481,"title":"","content":"The Contagion seemed the situation where people who would not normally join together would join together, because there's something awful there. A Contagion that threatens the existence of both parties, requiring them to team up to defeat them. After that, when the Contagion is gone people get to doing their own thing. They may stay in contact with members, but they may just try to forget them as they go back to their hopefully back to normal lives.<br /> <br /> If the beshilu and Hunters had an agreement to work against something that was screwing both of them over, then they might give each other a pass under certain occasions. Hunters agreeing not to kill the beshilu in a certain area, providing they stay in that area. Beshilu agreeing to avoid the Hunter in Darkness territory. But hosts aren't people, they're rabid monstrosities that only seem to care about three things, themselves, their drive to revive their progenitor, and hating werewolves. The hate represents itself in different ways and most established hosts are not going to go berserk at the sight of a werewolf, when they know there's more cunning ways to deal with the ancient enemy that has been bent on their genocide for thousands of years. If a Contagion affects them both similarly, they may relax enough to work at it, but they may just as likely kill each other to study the remains, or ensure that the other party isn't going to try it first. And if it affects one side and not the other it's hard to imagine either side lifting a finger to do anything to help the others.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-13T23:42:36-07:00","id":1388246,"title":"","content":"My players are dwelling deep into Iconoclasm Contagion, to find a permanent cure. Any idea what can it be, from <b>Werewolf: The Forsaken</b> point of gameline?<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>wyrdhamster</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1304111-contagion-fan-your-outbreaks?p=1309390#post1309390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:16px\"><b>Symptoms</b></span><br /> <br /> <b>Outbreak Core:</b> It starts with your secondary traces of being. People start to miss you in conversation. You lose reflection, then your shadow. Then people omit you in life. And, finally, you simply cease to exist.<br /> <br /> Contagion started with Ephemeral Beings ( spirits, ghosts, goetia, angels, etc. ), worshiped as sacred items and anchored to those images. Spirits and ghosts started to lose Manifestations, then their Essence \u2013 then their Corpus, being erased from reality. As the Contagion spread, even non-infected individuals lose they reflections \u2013 like the mirrors and water resists to show anyone living in them. ( Non-infected undead like vampires and sin-eaters <i>are</i> still shown. ) And finally whole glory of Empire is forgotten and lost.<br /> <br /> Stages of Contagion are describing firstly effects on Ephemeral Beings, then after \u2018/\u2019 for the humans and physical monsters. Beasts of Dark Mother, Bound Sin-Eaters and Uratha werewolves are in worst situation because of this Plague \u2013 they response they were are <i>both</i> Ephemeral and physical beings, at once. On Stage 2 they lose Essence/Plasm/Satiety <i>and</i> their shadow. And on Stage 3 they lose Corpus ( Health in reality ) <i>and</i> lose contact with outside world.<br /> <br /> <b>Contagion Carrier (Persistent)</b><ol class=\"decimal\"><li><b>Contagion-Touched</b> \u2013 Social penalty -1 to express oneself / Social penalty -1 as people subconsciously omit Touched in conversation.</li> <li><b>Infected (1)</b> \u2013 Blocking of 1 Manifestation per day. When loss of last one \u2013 next stage. / Loss of reflection in water, mirrors and similar.</li> <li><b>Infected (2)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 extra Essence per day. Cannot use Numina and Influences as ephemeral entity lacks the bodily cohesion to interact with other beings in Twilight. ( From lack of Twilight Form. ) A ghost who suffers this fate drifts through Twilight unable to be seen or touched even by other Twilight ghosts, alone and helpless to affect the world in any way, even only the world of ghosts. Spirit is locked in Twilight and cannot move to Shadow Realm on it\u2019s own. When loss of last one Essence point \u2013 next stage. If being has physical representation and at least 3 other material beings worship the representation \u2013 Essence lost is stopped for 24 hours. / Loss of shadow on any light source.</li> <li><b>Infected (3)</b> \u2013 Loss of 1 Corpus point per day. Uratha are checking entering Basu-Im each night because of Essence hunger. Begotten has 0 Satiety. When loss of Corpus box \u2013 final stage. / People do not notice you unless you make physical contact ( transmitting Contagion then ).</li> <li><b>Disappearance</b> \u2013 Final outcome, you cease to exist.</li> </ol><b><span style=\"font-size:16px\">Consequences of Contagion</span></b><br /> <b>Ephemeral Beings:</b><ul><li><b>Loss of Manifestations </b>\u2013 Slow disappearance of Twilight Form, Reaching, Fetter and Posses or Claim makes ephemerals not possible to affect humans \u2013 so no healing, blessings and overwatching of spiritual entities of humanity. More deadly accidents, weaker tools, and first and foremost \u2013 no influence of ghosts and spirits on the mortals. People are becoming more and more agnostic in their worships.</li> <li><b>Loss of Essence ( and a like ) </b>\u2013 Weaker spirits ( and other ephemerals ) are easier prey for their enemies. Predatory spirits are more violent, weakened by Contagion spirits and ghosts looks for the way to jump over to the Flesh World and collect Essence directly. Spiritual landscapes madness. Hungry Werewolves without Essence and Beasts Satiety going down implies rampaging Uratha and Horrors in physical bodies on Flesh World. Mortals become more dull and detached from their emotions.</li> <li><b>Ephemerals cease to exist </b>\u2013 Like in Loss of Essence, but much more direct. Spirit World and Primordial Dream is turn upside-down with gaps in ecology. Underworld is much more \u2018hungry\u2019 as ghosts-slaves of it are disappearing. All the realms are starting to \u2018steal\u2019 mortals in place of their native ephemerals, to fill the roosters.</li> </ul></div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-06-11T02:00:28-07:00","id":1395790,"title":"","content":"As wanting to focus my Werewolf game on Contagion stuff\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Fighting Contagion as Hunt</b> \u2013<b> WtF </b>2E is all about Hunt, so even fight with Contagion should feel like it, yes? How would you make feel of going after Contagion to feel like Hunt? Can you declare Sacred Hunt on the Contagion strain? How to make Cure a probable Prey in the story?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-08-30T04:48:34-07:00","id":1411062,"title":"","content":"So I return to the idea of Iconoclasm and <b>Werewolf</b>, returning to my game. Watching werewolf media, I think that my players need clear Prey to hunt the Contagion \u2013 werewolves stories are about hunting, in the end \u2013 and hunting the Iconclasm Contagion itself would be to nebulous as enemy. <b>I think about Prey that would reflecting the spread of the Iconclasm in Constantinopole \u2013 leading to at least stop of the large stop of spreading in city, or as the \u2018disease sample\u2019 to devise the Cure.</b> Maybe some sick and mutated Spirit Lord as Prey? What do you think?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}